    "body": "## Summary\n- reject unknown JSON properties instead of silently accepting undeclared client fields\n- snapshot every REST/STOMP request DTO and its explicit wire-field allowlist\n- require validation, nested validation cascades, typed project DTOs, and no Jackson alias/ignore/any-setter escape hatches\n- recursively prevent controllers from returning JPA persistence models\n- document and close roadmap items #621–#622\n\n## Audited surface\n- 38 REST request-body parameters + 1 STOMP payload\n- 38 direct-or-nested request DTO types\n- one raw exception: the exact Stripe webhook string verified against `Stripe-Signature`\n- no entity, generic map, `Object`, JSON-tree, `BeanUtils`, `copyProperties`, or `ModelMapper` transport path\n\n## Validation\n- exact remote head: `d002111536ccbe269ece6bbd9f12174e1ab2d63c`\n- remote tree matches local tree `6311b7a3a62102d75556fedbf004aca54c9618fe`\n- exactly one commit ahead of `master`, zero behind\n- `git diff --check`\n- request/payload and DTO snapshot counts agree\n- roadmap invariant: 965 unique entries (`621 ✅ / 2 🟢 / 77 🟡 / 265 🔴`)\n- local Maven is unavailable in this runner; GitHub Actions is the authoritative compile/test gate",
